## PHASE 0 — Schema & shared types (BLOCKING)

### 0.1 Prisma schema (`prisma/schema.prisma`)

Add enum and extend `CampaignParticipant`:

```prisma
enum CampaignParticipantRole {
  direct
  coordinator
  member
}

model CampaignParticipant {
  // ... keep all existing fields ...
  role                   CampaignParticipantRole @default(direct)
  canInviteMembers       Boolean                 @default(false)
  shareToken             String?                 @unique
  invitedByParticipantId String?
  coordinatorGroupLabel  String?

  invitedBy CampaignParticipant?  @relation("ParticipantTree", fields: [invitedByParticipantId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  invitees  CampaignParticipant[] @relation("ParticipantTree")

  @@index([campaignId, role])
  @@index([invitedByParticipantId])
  @@index([shareToken])
}
```

Optional Phase 7 fields on `TailorClient`:

```prisma
  userId                  String?
  campaignParticipantId   String? @unique
```

Run migration: `npx prisma migrate dev --name campaign_coordinator_hierarchy`

