## PHASE 6 — Export, notifications, edge cases

### 6.1 CSV export

**File:** `src/lib/measurementCampaigns.ts` — `buildParticipantsCsv`

Add columns after "Channel":
- `Role`
- `Invited by`
- `Group label`

Populate from DTO fields. Apply to both single-campaign and all-campaign export if exists.

### 6.2 Notifications

**File:** `src/lib/measurementCampaigns.ts`

On events:
| Event | Notify tailor | Notify coordinator |
|-------|---------------|-------------------|
| Member joins via group link | Yes | Yes (best effort) |
| Member completes measurements | Yes | Yes if under coordinator |
| Coordinator completes | Yes | — |

Use existing `notifyCampaignOwnerBestEffort` pattern. Add `notifyParticipantBestEffort(userId, ...)` if userId present on coordinator.

### 6.3 Reminders

**File:** `sendCampaignReminders` — no change required for v1 (reminds all pending). Optional: add `coordinatorParticipantId` filter param in Phase 5 enhancement.

### 6.4 Edge cases (MUST handle)

1. **User already direct participant tries group link** — unique `[campaignId, userId]` prevents duplicate; return existing row (no role change)
2. **Coordinator tries to join own group link** — reject or no-op with message
3. **Expired campaign** — block join and coordinator invites
4. **Archived campaign** — block all mutations
5. **Coordinator demoted** — not in v1 (tailor cannot demote); document as future
6. **shareToken collision** — regenerate on retry (extremely unlikely)
7. **`completeCampaignParticipation`** — verify works for members/coordinators (should unchanged; verify participant resolution accepts member rows)

### 6.5 Query invalidation matrix

After any mutation, invalidate:

| Mutation | Invalidate |
|----------|------------|
| joinCampaign | `campaignKeys.public(*)`, `campaignKeys.mine()`, `campaignKeys.participants(campaignId)` |
| coordinator invite | `campaignKeys.mine()`, `campaignKeys.coordinatorInvitees(id)`, `campaignKeys.participants(campaignId)` |
| tailor invite | `campaignKeys.participants(campaignId)` |
| submit measurements | `campaignKeys.mine()`, `campaignKeys.participants(campaignId)`, `measurementKeys.*` |

